<title>BELGIUM: Luxembourg BCEE 1996 net profit up 11.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg BCEE 1996 net profit up 11.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			1.979    vs    1.774</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total	 878.2	vs  790.7</p>
<p>    Private client deposits   466.8	vs  426.1</p>
<p>    Non-bank lending	    205.6	vs  209.1</p>
<p>    Bank client deposits	256.4	  down  1.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Luxembourg savings bank Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat (BCEE) said that after strong growth in 1994 and 1995 growth was exceptional in 1996.</p>
<p>The bank has AA+/A-1 ratings from Standard &amp; Poor's and Aa1/P-1 from Moody's.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
